### IPP-1703 Admin -> Users -> Details (study progress + quiz performance)
### Put ADMIN_PASSWORD from server/.env while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back.
### Use a normal user who has some "done" questions and a few quizzes.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = askedin143@gmail.com
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword = CHANGE_ME
@userSearch = arsalmustafa62%2Bipp2@gmail.com
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userId = {{userList.response.body.data.users.0._id}}


### 1. Admin login -> 200, data.user.lastLoginAt = now
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### 2. Normal user login -> 200, data.user.lastLoginAt + lastSeenAt = now
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### 3. Find the user -> 200, 1 user ("+" sent as %2B, else the search finds nobody)
# @name userList
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search={{userSearch}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 4. Details -> 200 with:
###   user (no bookmarks array, bookmarksCount, paidBy {name,email} or null)
###   activity { lastSeenAt, lastLoginAt, lastStudied, lastQuiz }
###   study { done, total, percent, thisWeek, languages[ { done, total, topics[ { done, total, locked } ] } ], recentDone (max 5), bookmarks (max 10) }
###   quizzes { count, sampleCount, average, best, trend { direction, points (max 10) }, languages, weakTopics (max 5), recent (max 10) }
###   Unpaid user: topics after the first one have locked: true
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/details
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 5. Give full access -> 200 (if already on, turn it off first in the UI). Then step 4 again: user.paidBy = admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPaid": true }


### 6. Normal user cannot open details -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/details
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 7. Bad id -> 400 "Invalid user id"
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/abc/details
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 8. Unknown id -> 404 "User not found"
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/000000000000000000000000/details
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 9. Browser: Admin -> Users -> click a name or "Details" -> side panel opens.
###    Study progress tab: language click opens topics; Quizzes tab: trend bars, weak topics, last 10.
###    Esc / X / click outside closes. Check dark mode too.
### 10. Admin -> Backup -> Download full backup -> users have paidBy (email), lastLoginAt, lastSeenAt.
